<view class="container">
  <view class="kicker">BRAIN GYM · 每天 3 分钟</view>
  <view class="title">每天 3 分钟，<text style="color:#f0a33a;">打一局高能</text></view>
  <view class="subtitle">有的关卡可以一直玩，有的想明白一次就够。先选能反复玩的，再玩经典解谜。</view>

  <view class="stats">
    <view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{streak}}</text><text class="stat-label">连续天数</text></view>
    <view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{playedCount}}/{{games.length}}</text><text class="stat-label">玩过关卡</text></view>
    <view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">3</text><text class="stat-label">分钟一局</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="daily-card" bindtap="openDaily">
    <view class="daily-kicker">每日一题 · {{today}}</view>
    <view class="daily-title">今天先闯一关</view>
    <view class="daily-desc">不用注册，答完就看解释；连续答题会记录天数。</view>
    <view class="daily-btn">开始答题 →</view>
  </view>

  <view class="quick-row">
    <view class="quick" bindtap="openPractice">
      <text class="quick-emoji">📅</text>
      <view class="quick-main">
        <text class="quick-title">每日一练</text>
        <text class="quick-desc">今天 3 个可重复玩的关卡</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="quick" bindtap="openRandom">
      <text class="quick-emoji">🎲</text>
      <view class="quick-main">
        <text class="quick-title">随机体验</text>
        <text class="quick-desc">只从可重复玩的关卡里抽</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <text class="section-title">一直能玩 · {{replayGames.length}}</text>
    <text class="section-sub">每局答案/牌面都变化</text>
  </view>
  <view class="grid">
    <view wx:for="{{replayGames}}" wx:key="key" class="game-card" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="openGame">
      <view class="game-top">
        <text class="game-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</text>
        <text class="game-tag">{{item.tag}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="game-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="game-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      <view class="game-foot"><text class="native">可重复</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head classic-head">
    <text class="section-title">经典解谜 · 玩一次就懂 · {{classicGames.length}}</text>
    <text class="section-sub">想明白就通关，单独放</text>
  </view>
  <view class="grid">
    <view wx:for="{{classicGames}}" wx:key="key" class="game-card classic" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="openGame">
      <view class="game-top">
        <text class="game-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</text>
        <text class="game-tag">{{item.tag}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="game-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="game-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      <view class="game-foot"><text class="classic-badge">一次性解谜</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <text>不刷题，不排名，不用注册。\n日常随机只抽能反复玩的关卡。</text>
  </view>
</view>
